lation</a></li><li><a href="/ai/marketing">AI in marketing</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer__row"><h4><a href="/genres">Genres</a></h4><ul><li><a href="/genres/action">Action</a></li><li><a href="/genres/adventure">Adventure</a></li><li><a href="/genres/casual">Casual</a></li><li><a href="/genres/indie">Indie</a></li><li><a href="/genres/rpg">RPG</a></li><li><a href="/genres/simulation">Simulation</a></li><li><a href="/genres/strategy">Strategy</a></li><li><a href="/genres/sports">Sports</a></li><li><a href="/genres/racing">Racing</a></li><li><a href="/genres/massively-multiplayer">MMO</a></li><li><a href="/genres/free-to-play">Free to play</a></li></ul></div></nav><div class="footer__bottom"><div class="footer__notes"><span>Game data from public Steam store pages. GameDB.ai is not affiliated with Valve.</span><span class="footer__proto">Revenue and wishlists are GameDB estimates · AI labels are read from each game’s Steam disclosure</span><span class="footer__legal"><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a><button type="button" data-open-consent="">Cookie settings</button></span></div><div class="theme-switch" role="group" aria-label="Color theme"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-moon"></use></svg>Dark</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="true"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-sun"></use></svg>Light</button></div></div></div></footer><dialog class="modal" id="claim-dialog" aria-labelledby="claim-title"><div class="modal__form"><header class="modal__head"><div><p class="eyebrow">For developers</p><h2 id="claim-title">Claim your game</h2></div><button type="button" class="icon-btn" aria-label="Close"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-x"></use></svg></button></header><form class="modal__stack" noValidate=""><p class="modal__le